sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Ingress as Ingress Layer<br/>(Gateway API / Istio VS /<br/>OpenShift Route)
    participant Router as InferenceGraph Router<br/>(cmd/router)
    participant KubeAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Predictor as Model Server Pod<br/>(Serving Runtime)<br/>HTTP 8080 / gRPC
    participant Storage as Object Storage<br/>(S3/GCS/Azure/HDFS)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,Storage: Flow 1: Standard InferenceService Request
    Client->>Ingress: POST /v1/models/{model}:predict<br/>HTTPS/443
    Ingress->>Predictor: Forward request<br/>(mTLS via Service Mesh)
    Predictor->>Storage: Load model artifacts<br/>HTTPS/443 (IAM/Credentials)
    Storage-->>Predictor: Model artifacts
    Predictor-->>Ingress: V2 Prediction Response (JSON)
    Ingress-->>Client: HTTPS Response

    Note over Client,Storage: Flow 2: InferenceGraph with Auth
    Client->>Ingress: POST /v1/models/{graph}:predict<br/>HTTPS/443, Bearer Token
    Ingress->>Router: Forward to router
    Router->>KubeAPI: TokenReview (validate Bearer token)
    KubeAPI-->>Router: Token valid
    Router->>KubeAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>(authorize on InferenceGraph resource)
    KubeAPI-->>Router: Authorized
    Router->>Predictor: Forward to step nodes<br/>(/single, /ensemble, /splitter, /switch)
    Predictor-->>Router: Step result
    Router-->>Ingress: Final response
    Ingress-->>Client: HTTPS Response

    Note over Client,Storage: Flow 3: Controller Reconciliation
    participant Operator as KServe Controller<br/>(manager binary)
    participant Webhook as Webhook Server<br/>443/TCP TLS
    Client->>KubeAPI: kubectl apply InferenceService
    KubeAPI->>Webhook: Admission request<br/>POST /mutate-serving-kserve-io-v1beta1-inferenceservice
    Webhook-->>KubeAPI: Mutated/validated response
    KubeAPI-->>Client: Resource created
    KubeAPI->>Operator: Watch notification
    Operator->>KubeAPI: Create Deployment, Service,<br/>HTTPRoute/VirtualService/Route,<br/>HPA/ScaledObject

    Note over Client,Storage: Flow 4: Metrics Collection
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus
    participant RBACProxy as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP TLS
    Prometheus->>RBACProxy: GET /metrics<br/>HTTPS/8443
    RBACProxy->>KubeAPI: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview
    KubeAPI-->>RBACProxy: Authorized
    RBACProxy->>Operator: Proxy to :8080/metrics<br/>HTTP (localhost)
    Operator-->>RBACProxy: Metrics payload
    RBACProxy-->>Prometheus: Metrics response

    Note over Client,Storage: Flow 5: LLMInferenceService with Gateway API
    participant LLMCtrl as LLMISvc Controller<br/>(llmisvc binary)
    participant GW as Gateway API<br/>Gateway + HTTPRoute
    participant InfPool as InferencePool<br/>(Gateway API Inference Extension)
    Client->>KubeAPI: kubectl apply LLMInferenceService
    KubeAPI->>LLMCtrl: Watch notification
    LLMCtrl->>KubeAPI: Create HTTPRoute, InferencePool,<br/>LeaderWorkerSet, ScaledObject
    Client->>GW: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS/443
    GW->>InfPool: Request-aware routing
    InfPool->>Predictor: Forward to LLM pod
    Predictor-->>GW: Streaming response
    GW-->>Client: HTTPS Response
